/// Compiler library: the `lib.cryo` of `[lib].source_dir = "src"`, so the
/// namespace below is the library's, and discovery of the library starts
/// here.  It imports each top-level namespace under src/ so the loader's
/// walk reaches the whole tree; a new top-level under src/ adds an import
/// line here.

namespace project::compiler;

import compiler;
import utils;
